HaloFuse for ComfyUI
====================

This extension is a modified version of an MIT-licensed ComfyUI cloud-rendering bridge.
The original copyright and permission notice are kept in LICENSE-MIT and apply to those portions:

    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 VFXGuru

This repository as a whole, including the HaloFuse changes (2026-11 onward), is distributed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0 (LICENSE).

Runtime dependencies (installed separately with requirements.txt; not bundled here):
- the cloud connector package named in requirements.txt (MIT licence)
- keyring (MIT licence)

Provided by ComfyUI at runtime (not bundled): aiohttp and the ComfyUI server API.

Test-only material under tests/ is not part of the distributed extension (see .comfyignore). It contains an
import-surface stand-in of the cloud connector package written for these tests; it copies no code from that package.
